</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By baptism in Thy death we’re one</l><l>And buried too with Thee:</l><l>Thus we’re forever dead to sin</l><l>And from its bondage free.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>By baptism in Thy death we’re one</l><l>And buried too with Thee;</l><l>Thus to the world we bid farewell,</l><l>From Satan’s slavery free.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We’re resurrected with Thee too,</l><l>From death’s great pow’r set free;</l><l>Now fruit of holiness we bear</l><l>In our new life with Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We’re baptized unto Thy dear name,</l><l>No more our own are we;</l><l>Thy steps we’d follow, for Thee live,</l><l>And e’er be one with Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
